      "message": "I think I need to pull this code and crack open a zip to compare.   Prior their were a few deps that did not get smooshed in to a single static zip.   The android-all, the robolectric-all, mockito.    In particular the android-all jar should not get repackaged, because robolectric relies on it being a representation of android, and if other classes get crammed in to the same jar, then there is a lot of logic that needs to be checked in robolectric.\n\nSimply reordering the artifacts that get repackaged via jarjar might \"work\" but will leave other debt.",
